        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>1) I have a card that says &quot;at the beginning of the villain phase, draw a card from the villain deck.&quot;&nbsp; A number of cards say something like that, so the specific one doesn&#39;t really matter.&nbsp; The card I draw says &quot;at the beginning of the villain phase, do XYZ&quot;.&nbsp; Do I do XYZ on the same turn I drew the card?&nbsp; Are we still in the beginning of the villain phase, or did that end when I followed all the directions on the card that I already had in hand?&nbsp;</p><p>Is this true for all &quot;beginning of&quot;/&quot;end of&quot; directions?&nbsp; Now, if you draw a card at the beginning of the phase that says do something at the end, I would think you would do it on the same turn.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>2) If I&#39;m in a situation where I&#39;m supposed to apply damage or healing to the hero with highest/lowest hit points, and I have a tie, do they both take damage or get healed?&nbsp; Do the players get to decide which one?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Thank you.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
