        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/spiff/{size}/1865_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-10-15T16:44:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>1) Yep, you're still in the Start phase, so if your new card says to do something during the Start phase, you have to do it.&nbsp; It's more common for this to happen during the villain's End phase, but it's the same thing.</p><p>2) The players get to choose in a tie like this, so you'd just pick which one you want to take the damage or the healing.</p><p>EDIT: dangit, I even refreshed before clicking \"submit\" to make sure I wasn't going to get ninjaed.&nbsp; Some ninjas are just that good.</p>",
